{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","托安"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名可以复活的坦克，擅长利用对手的伤害进行反击。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","所有人……都会付出代价。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Everyone must pay a price."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","强大或许能让我仁慈……一点点。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Power may make me more merciful. Little at least."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","你会得到回报！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","You'll get what's coming to you!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我总会归来。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I will always return..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","向王者致敬！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Kneel before the king!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","回归王座的道路，唯有怒火方能点亮……"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","啊，啊，啊，啊。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","你大概不会背叛我吧？你也不会吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","所有人都会付出代价，因为我已经富过了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","待我回归王座，你将会得到回报！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","很好。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","还没到休息的时候！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不能掉以轻心……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啊，一小杯酒，足够了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯变亮了……真刺眼"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","棒极了，寒冷的深夜……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……真够热闹的"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯光太刺眼了"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","托安生前是一个相当信任他人的君主，这也导致了他的帝国覆灭。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","托安常挂在嘴上的两个词——“背叛”与“复仇”。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","据说，托安刚复活时，曾发现自己的王冠少了一颗宝石。这颗宝石后来被盛在盒中，由一双断手捧着送还给托安，断手来自于那个窃贼。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","托安以重铸班题斯帝国的荣光为己任，这无人不晓的覆灭帝国版图曾超过如今的耀光。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","班题斯帝国的象征——亡灵圣器被窃，至今下落不明，托安至今仍在寻找其踪迹。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说，托安复活时，将许多生前的部下也一齐复活，又陆续放逐了那些因君主性情大变不再愿意追随的人。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据一些考古学家说，锈锚港周边不知为何保存着一些昔日班题斯帝国舰队的风貌。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据说，托安和那个追逐着生命力的亡灵组织有千丝万缕的联系，但亡灵猎人们尚且无法靠近托安，寻求真相。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","托安十分反感明明已经成为亡灵，还保留着生前温情与回忆的人。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","不知为何，据托安的一些部下透露，托安对神明并不十分敬畏。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","还没到休息的时候！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415124.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","啊，一小杯酒，足够了"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415125.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","……又到了这个季节。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415345.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","托安 & 维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","灯变亮了……真刺眼"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415435.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","棒极了，寒冷的深夜……"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415436.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","……真够热闹的"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415611.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","灯光太刺眼了"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415612.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","向您致敬，尊敬的陛下，能见到您真是我的无上荣幸。"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415699.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","沙利叶 & 托安"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","哼……"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415809.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","托安 & 格瑞泽尔勒（未完整）"]]}